@startuml
title UC-005 Obtain a Plausible Itinerary - Module Interaction
autonumber
actor Customer
participant "MOD-CI\nCustomer Interaction" as CI
participant "MOD-TPD\nTravel Product Design" as TPD
participant "MOD-TPM\nTravel Product Management" as TPM

Customer -> CI: checkItineraryPlausibility(itineraryVersion)
CI -> TPD: checkItineraryPlausibility(itineraryVersion)
TPD -> TPM: getServiceConstraints(serviceReferences)
TPM --> TPD: serviceConstraints
TPD --> CI: plausibilityResult
CI --> Customer: confirmation or blocking conflicts
@enduml
